# CODEOWNERS — TTL-Legacy
#
# GitHub automatically requests a review from the listed owners whenever a
# pull request modifies a matching file or directory.
#
# Syntax: <pattern>  <owner> [<owner> ...]
# Patterns follow the same rules as .gitignore.
# More specific patterns take precedence over less specific ones.
# Lines beginning with # are comments.
#
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default: repository owner reviews everything not covered by a more
# specific rule below.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
*  @OxDev-max

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backend — security-critical modules
#
# auth.rs     Passkey / WebAuthn authentication logic
# consensus.rs Multi-party consensus for high-value operations
# db.rs       Database access layer (SQL queries, connection pooling)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
backend/src/auth.rs       @OxDev-max
backend/src/consensus.rs  @OxDev-max
backend/src/db.rs         @OxDev-max
backend/src/db/           @OxDev-max

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contract source files
#
# All Rust source files under any contracts/ subdirectory, including the
# primary ttl_vault contract, the zk_verifier contract, and shared types.
# Fuzz targets and integration tests are included because they define the
# security boundary of the contract surface.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
contracts/**/*.rs  @OxDev-max

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release and CI pipeline
#
# Changes to release automation, the changelog template, and CI workflows
# can affect every downstream consumer of the project.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
.github/workflows/release.yml    @OxDev-max
.github/workflows/ci.yml         @OxDev-max
cliff.toml                       @OxDev-max
CHANGELOG.md                     @OxDev-max

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Security and governance documents
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
SECURITY.md        @OxDev-max
CODEOWNERS         @OxDev-max
